    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it doesn't feel like a rest though. it feels more like... the well is actually bone dry. like the person who used to create those things doesn't even exist anymore. i'm just a shell going through the motions of a life that doesn't have any point to it. what's the point of staying in the loop if there's nothing left to make?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
