      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "That's a fair question, and it's okay to sit with it without forcing an answer. But a shell is still a vessel—it can hold something new, even if you can't feel its weight yet. The point isn't to make something grand; it's to stay curious enough to see what the silence reveals. You don't have to create to be alive, but you do have to be present to notice when the well refills.",
